{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_7_level_main_07-05_beg",
  "groupId": "main_7",
  "stageId": "main_07-05",
  "title": "遺忘之地",
  "storyCode": "7-6",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7b19ad759ba21259d1b430159b08964ca2da89fa767bdc770a0d74ba10dbae10",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "切爾諾伯格地下基建\n10:30 a.m."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你在這，是在等我？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "是。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "找你花了我很長時間。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我們會在環境資訊匯總完畢後開始行動。在這之前，更多地向你描述一些核心城內的現狀會對你有幫助。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "阿米婭還要處理現場，這次討論，她就不參加了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "任務簡報你都已經看過。但那些資料對於你的頭腦來說，並不夠多。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你終於意識到需要我了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凱爾希",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "如果最壞的情況發生，我不希望你犧牲的不明不白。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凱爾希",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "如果你對我五官中的某個部分很在意，可以直接指出來。不用一直盯著我看。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "我還以為你當我只會戰地指揮。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凱爾希",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "雖然你可能忘了，但我記得。我記得你相當擅長在凌晨四點時，用沸騰的飲用水直接在口腔中加熱速食食品。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凱爾希",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "至於是不是真的，你也許可以試試。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "不說閒話。我們的時間沒有多充裕。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "羅德島與近衛局在龍門合作擊敗了整合運動，擊潰了“梅菲斯特”和“弑君者”帶領的武裝力量。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "這之後，整合運動在龍門的部署已經全部失效。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "阿米婭向我報告過，你們與整合運動的特殊小隊指揮官，別稱“霜星”的感染者，在龍門城邦的底部展開了殊死搏鬥。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "戰鬥以你們的勝利告終。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "沒人贏。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "不。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "那不算是勝利。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "可以理解。根據PRTS申報的資料，在幹員的協力下，你正是在羅德島處理了敵對感染者的遺體。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我不認為她是敵人。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，“分清敵我”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "......不。也許這會讓你會錯意，請聽我說完。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我沒有指責你，Dr.{@nickname}。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我從阿米婭的講述中瞭解了敵指揮官的情況。現場的判斷屬於你們，如何看待他們，只能由身在現場的你們決定。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我沒有跳出職責來判斷立場的權力。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "你曾經嘗試去理解感染者的行為動機，你願意承擔她——霜星——所作所為導致的所有後果。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "你也這麼做了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "如果你打算誠實地去瞭解這片大地，博士，我沒有指責你的理由。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我甚至可以向羅德島幹員擔保你的行為。堅持下去，Dr.{@nickname}，做自己的決定，我會儘量不做干涉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "之後的後果，我會解決羅德島應承擔的那部分。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "你的責任與權力相輔相成。“分清敵我”，是你自己的判斷，不是我的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "（輕聲）如果你真的與他們共同呼吸。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我這麼做......你其實完全認可？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我沒有這麼說過。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "言歸正傳。霜星及其率領的小隊，也就是“雪怪小隊”，從屬於一支感染者遊擊隊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "現在，整合運動能夠驅策的精銳武裝力量只剩下兩支。感染者遊擊隊是其中一支。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "另一支，是由薩卡茲雇傭兵“W”帶領的薩卡茲雇傭軍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "據我所知，W依賴一系列手段，竊取了整合運動這支薩卡茲雇傭軍的領頭人地位。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "因為我們沒時間複習歷史常識，所以我直截了當地告訴你——薩卡茲雇傭軍並不可靠，對W，對整合運動，都一樣。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "薩卡茲雇傭軍並不是普通的雇傭兵組織。他們是卡茲戴爾無處容放的軍事力量在大地各處的流露。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "妄圖控制它，只會引來他們背後的牽線人。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你似乎對薩卡茲有很深的瞭解。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "這不是重點。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "重點在於，雪怪小隊所屬的感染者遊擊隊和雇傭兵全然不同。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "形式，編制，行事方式以及準則，遊擊隊和雇傭兵之間沒有一點相似之處。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "在成為整合運動的武裝前，它是獨立的感染者遊擊隊，他們的威名在特定區域的感染者中比它的後起之秀整合運動更加響亮。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "......在成為遊擊隊之前，他們曾是烏薩斯強大軍事力量的一部分。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是西北凍原的遊擊隊？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "無論你從哪裡得到了這條資訊，博士，我都該為此誇讚你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "儘管這樣的情報很基礎，但你能主動去獲取情報這一行為，讓我感到欣慰。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "誇我不用拐彎抹角。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我有點懷疑你在諷刺我？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "點到為止。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我們身處切爾諾伯格核心城的基礎工業結構處。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "接下來，我們帶領的這三支小隊將穿過錯綜複雜的地下通道、下水管道與工業層，前往核心城的中央區域。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "注意，哪怕是恰巧在這裡巡邏的敵人，也不會是普通的整合運動暴徒。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我們會遇見經過嚴苛訓練的......“士兵”。遊擊隊以烏薩斯現役軍的訓練方式訓練過的整合運動“士兵”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "偵查幹員發現核心城內的通訊遭到了人為切斷，或者說，整合運動並沒有嘗試維持城內的通訊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "這對於利用常規通訊手法進行交流的現代小隊有著很強的制約力。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "卻也意味著，整合運動也有特殊的通訊手段，或者是他們完全沒有準備好應戰。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "參照一個月前在切爾諾伯格發生的事件，後者的情況幾乎不會發生。但是，切斷通訊，底層的整合運動將不會收到任何直接命令。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "大多數時間裡，他們會自由行事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "恐怕他們還不知道，他們頻道收不到的那個信號——那個只有國家與城邦才能辨別的信號，正在劃定烏薩斯的疆域。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "這是一座醞釀著風暴的城區。混亂，無論是無意還是故意，都會像沉重的煙霧一樣四處彌漫。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "先我一步，崩潰的種子已經被人播撒出去了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "結論呢？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "某種衝突正在整合運動內部孕育。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你很確定？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "類似的事情在這片大地上發生過無數遍。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你是不是還有什麼沒和我說？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "能說的差不多就這些，剩下的，等要討論的時候再討論。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "即使我們只是在做戰前準備工作，我們也要兼顧效率。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "請你幫我通知R-4小隊的成員，博士。請他們來取這批裝置。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......等一等......？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "還有什麼問題？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這些裝置似乎是迷迭香的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "是的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "那麼，你與迷迭香幹員的交流似乎並不局限於生物處理室裡的談話。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我看到她準備戰鬥的樣子。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "很難想像她居然有使用這種裝置的力量。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "事實上，每一個精英幹員都具備相當的力量。他們必須獨當一面。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "……所以你還沒來得及了解迷迭香的戰鬥方式。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "事先聲明，有些事情不只該他們自己承擔。羅德島的戰地指揮官身負多種職能，幫忙分擔幹員身上的壓力，也是其中必要的一環。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "在這之後的戰鬥中，你可能會被某些事實衝擊。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "啊......？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "很少有不會被迷迭香的戰鬥震懾住的人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "做好心理準備。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，你來了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們截住了敵人的巡邏小隊，正在穩步處理中。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "戰鬥已經開始了？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，你的位置有點危險......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我建議你不要站在那個位置。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我才剛剛到位。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你那裡，那裡是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅德島幹員",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，她身邊真的很危險！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......敵人。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "難道說......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......迷迭香？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "敵人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，那些是殺害我家人的......敵人！"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你怎麼這麼凶？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "迷迭香？發生什麼事......",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，讓一讓。不要待在這條走道。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我和阿米婭不一樣。阿米婭的法術能繞過家人，準確地懲罰別人......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我不能。我做不到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "所以，不要站在迷迭香和戰場之間。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "噫！！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那個背著大盒子的女孩，怎，怎，怎麼......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我的眼睛要看不到了，我的眼睛，我的頭！！好痛！好痛！！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "有什麼東西要把我捏碎了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不會的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我已經很久沒捏死過人了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那些劍，那些劍——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "迷迭香？！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "整合運動......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我不要你們留在我的記憶裡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我不要。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
